dex_rule":"Index = the market-cap band the stock sits in on TODAY's NSE lists: Nifty 50, Next 50, Midcap (NIFTY Midcap 150), Smallcap (NIFTY Smallcap 250), Microcap (NIFTY Microcap 250), or Outside all of them. The bands do not overlap and cover all 747 listed constituents. The full membership list (Nifty 100 / 200 / 500 too) is on each row as `ixs`.","basis":"traded = change in bonus/split-adjusted shares x that month's implied price (industry market value / industry shares). Entries are full purchases, exits full sales, a merger is neither (null). Shares are on today's basis.","source":"SEBI monthly portfolio disclosures via MFI360; corporate actions from NSE; stock identity from the NSE bhavcopy lineage"}}